{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──おーい、だらけてないで\r\n終わったか、宿題？","trans":"——喂，别这么懒散\n作业写完了吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017780010","name":"透","text":"……え\r\nんー、終わらん","trans":"……咦\n嗯——没写完","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017780030","name":"透","text":"なんか、ちょうだい\r\nプレゼントとか","trans":"给我点什么吧\n礼物之类的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え？\r\n……なんだ、急に","trans":"诶？\n……什么啊，突然这样","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017780040","name":"透","text":"出ないから\r\nやる気","trans":"因为提不起来\n干劲","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………\r\nほら","trans":"…………\n喏","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017780050","name":"透","text":"あー\r\nおにぎりかー……","trans":"啊——\n饭团啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}